  <h2 id="sales">Who pays for these skills, and how they judge you</h2>

  <p>
    Public research bodies select on exams, interviews and qualifications. They judge you by subject depth, lab discipline and integrity.
  </p>
  <p>
    The first basic skill is keeping a clean, dated lab or data record.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai">AI and government science jobs after BSc: which tasks are under pressure</h2>

  <p>
    AI tools explain concepts and draft reports. Routine record formatting shrinks.
  </p>
  <p>
    Careful measurement, honest reporting and accountability hold value. A staged path helps: now, use AI to explain and quiz; later, own experiments and results.
  </p>

